erves%20as%20a%20vital%20platform%20for%20the%20heads%20of%20examination%20boards%20across%20the%20country.%20It%20collaborates%20with%20both%20local%20and%20international%20institutions%20to%20set%20unified%20policies%20and%20standards%20in%20academic%20evaluation%2C%20examination%2C%20and%20assessment.&en=page_view&_fv=1&_nsi=1&_ss=1&_ee=1&tfd=3036","queryString":[{"name":"v","value":"2"},{"name":"tid","value":"G-MTXV1E8CFT"},{"name":"gtm","value":"45je68e1v9194545357za200zd9194545357"},{"name":"_p","value":"1788362806379"},{"name":"gcd","value":"13l3l3l3l1l1"},{"name":"npa","value":"0"},{"name":"dma","value":"0"},{"name":"cid","value":"1754720621.1788362809"},{"name":"frm","value":"0"},{"name":"ngs","value":"1"},{"name":"pscdl","value":"noapi"},{"name":"rcb","value":"10"},{"name":"sr","value":"800x600"},{"name":"uaa","value":"arm"},{"name":"uab","value":"64"},{"name":"uafvl","value":"Not%3FA_Brand;24.0.0.0|Chromium;152.0.7977.54"},{"name":"uam","value":""},{"name":"uamb","value":"0"},{"name":"uap","value":"macOS"},{"name":"uapv","value":"14.4.1"},{"name":"uaw","value":"0"},{"name":"ul","value":"en-us"},{"name":"_s","value":"1"},{"name":"tag_exp","value":"115616986~115938465~115938469~118897920~118897930~119367802~119367810~120385423"},{"name":"sid","value":"1788362808"},{"name":"sct","value":"1"},{"name":"seg","value":"0"},{"name":"dl","value":"https://ibcc.edu.pk/"},{"name":"dt","value":"Inter Boards Coordination Commission (IBCC) – The Inter Boards Coordination Commission (IBCC), reconstituted in April 2023 through the IBCC Act (Act XIII of 2023), is a national body under the auspices of the Ministry of Federal Education and Professional Training (MoFE&PT) dedicated to enhancing secondary and higher secondary education standards across Pakistan. Established in 1972 as the Inter Boards Committee of Chairmen, the IBCC serves as a vital platform for the heads of examination boards across the country. It collaborates with both local and international institutions t